        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86051, Rustic Sandcast Bronze Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Bin Pull is made of sandcast bronze and so, each piece is different where the mold had its own characteristics and these details give it a rustic feel that accentuates it's beauty. The Rustic Sandcast Bronze Cup Pull is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. Choose from 3 inch or 4 inch lengths. Each kitchen drawer cup pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Sandcast Bronze Bin Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86051-specifications.pdf?v=1704262411\"><b>Emtek Sandcast Bronze Bin Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86051:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86050:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
